From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...wift => __Queue where S is Store.Direct, S is ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...wift => __Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...wift => __Queue where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} | 0
 Sources/Queue/{Queue+Columns.swift => __Queue.swift}              | 0
 4 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Queue Primitive/{Queue.Bounded.swift => __Queue where S is Store.Direct, S is ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Queue Primitive/{Queue.Index.swift => __Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Queue Small Primitive/{Queue.Small.swift => __Queue where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Queue/{Queue+Columns.swift => __Queue.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Queue Primitive/Queue.Bounded.swift b/Sources/Queue Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.Direct, S is ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue Primitive/Queue.Bounded.swift
rename to Sources/Queue Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.Direct, S is ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Queue Primitive/Queue.Index.swift b/Sources/Queue Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue Primitive/Queue.Index.swift
rename to Sources/Queue Primitive/__Queue where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Queue Small Primitive/Queue.Small.swift b/Sources/Queue Small Primitive/__Queue where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue Small Primitive/Queue.Small.swift
rename to Sources/Queue Small Primitive/__Queue where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Queue/Queue+Columns.swift b/Sources/Queue/__Queue.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Queue/Queue+Columns.swift
rename to Sources/Queue/__Queue.swift
